# ───────── 二进制运行时依赖（体积大，不进仓库）─────────
# 这些是随包分发的第三方二进制：ffmpeg / adb / Android SDK / 虚拟显示驱动。
# 安装包（DroidExtend-Setup-*.exe）里已经带齐，源码仓库不重复存一份。
tools/ffmpeg/
tools/platform-tools/
tools/sdk/
tools/vdd/

# ───────── 构建产物 ─────────
_internal/
DroidExtend.exe
dist/
android/build/
tools/pybuild/
*.spec
# The signing key must never be published: anyone holding it can ship an
# "update" that Android will happily install over the real app.  build.py
# regenerates one automatically if it is missing.
android/droidextend.keystore
*.keystore
*.jks

# ───────── 调试与临时文件 ─────────
tools/tmp/
tools/shots/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.h264

# ───────── 编辑器 / 系统 ─────────
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
